            Paragraph(Text("A retained nonzero coefficient gives strictly positive original coefficient mass. The uniform lower bound gives a positive complete tail at max(N,N0), and nonnegative tail cropping transfers positivity to N. This is a consequence of the uniform estimate; the source realization below uses that consequence on the literal three-node head.")),
